{
  "dom_id": "step-q301575",
  "name": "Question 2",
  "problem": "Evaluate the following limit:\n\n${lim}_{x\\to \\pi }\\operatorname{sec}⁡(x)=$\n{{field-1}}",
  "worked_solution": "Substituting $x=\\pi $ directly into the limit, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{x\\to \\pi }\\operatorname{sec}⁡(x) & =\\operatorname{sec}⁡(\\pi ) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\pi )} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{(-1)} \\\\  & =-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
